  "contentPreview": "PRE-EXISTING PRODUCT DEFECT (discovered 2026-08-04 during the store-unification branch, NOT caused by it). A throwing IMemoryEventSink can crash the whole process. \u0060dotnet test --blame-crash\u0060 on tests/Scrinia.Tests reports: \u0060Test host process crashed : [scrinia:warn] Event sink ThrowingSink error: InvalidOperationException: boom\u0060. The run aborts partway, so vstest still prints \u0060Passed! Failed: 0\u0060 with a TRUNCATED count \u2014 which is how it hid for so long. Impact beyond tests: any plugin sink that",
