    {
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "Evidence it is NOT the store-unification branch\u0027s doing: (1) CompositeEventSinkTests passes 3/3 in 9ms in ISOLATION, so it is an interaction, not a broken test; (2) the abort reproduces at pre-branch and mid-branch commits alike; (3) \u0060git diff \u003Cmerge-base\u003E..HEAD\u0060 shows the branch never touched CompositeEventSink.cs, IMemoryEventSink.cs, or CompositeEventSinkTests.cs \u2014 the single FireEventSinkAsync line in the branch diff is an unchanged CONTEXT line; (4) it is INTERMITTENT, depending on GC/final",
