    {
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "Likely mechanism: MemoryTools.Core.FireEventSinkAsync dispatches sinks via a detached Task.Run. An exception escaping on a background thread with no observer can terminate the process. This is the fire-and-forget pattern the 2026-08-03 design review flagged independently.",
