    {
      "chunkIndex": 5,
      "contentPreview": "SEPARATE, UNRELATED environment trap found the same day: apparent test-run \u0027hangs\u0027 are orphaned testhost.exe / dotnet.exe processes left by earlier killed runs, still holding FileLocks on temp stores under %TEMP%. A full run exceeded 600s with one stale process alive and completed in 54s after \u0060taskkill /F /IM testhost.exe\u0060 and \u0060/IM dotnet.exe\u0060. Always clear strays before a full-suite run, and never run two \u0060dotnet test\u0060 invocations against the same project concurrently \u2014 they contend and abort.",
